# The Darkwoods classification data, added 2026-08-27. Same treatment as the other
# data folders above: rasters and the large model tables go to LFS, because
# 02.inputs/beetle-classification/model-data/model_table.csv alone is 98 MB and
# GitHub rejects any single blob over 100 MB. The unset rules below this block keep
# scripts and documentation diffable, and they must stay after these lines to win.
02.inputs/beetle-classification/**/*.tif  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
02.inputs/beetle-classification/**/*.gpkg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
02.inputs/beetle-classification/**/*.rds  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
02.inputs/beetle-classification/model-data/*.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
