# The same data after the folder was renamed to 02.inputs/beetle, added 2026-10-01
# when the push of commit 492c7ec drew GitHub's 50 MB warning on eight files, the
# largest 02.inputs/beetle/model-data-redstage/model_table.csv at 98.3 MB. Only the
# model tables and the R data files go to LFS. The small results CSVs in the same
# folders, which the manuscript reads for its numbers, stay as diffable text.
02.inputs/beetle/**/*.rds  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
02.inputs/beetle/model-data*/*model_table*.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Source and documentation under 02.inputs must stay diffable text rather than
# LFS pointers. `text` alone is not enough: the broad rules above set
# filter=lfs, so these must unset it with `!filter !diff !merge`.
02.inputs/**/*.R   !filter !diff !merge text
02.inputs/**/*.md  !filter !diff !merge text
02.inputs/**/*.txt !filter !diff !merge text
02.inputs/climate/station-winter-minima.csv !filter !diff !merge text

